          "evidence_id": "sfev-60faf5d4ff2f4b76",
          "evidence_type": "scientific_or_technical_explanation",
          "paraphrase": "A quasi-scholarly text describes a specific kind of vampire that only preys on its own family and appears as a normal living male unaware of his condition.",
