              "backend": "anthropic",
              "normalization_notes": [],
              "raw_id": "ev01",
              "source": "model",
              "source_chunk_id": null
            }
          ],
          "quote": "As in the case of Autiel Duryea we observe that this specimen\n     of _vrykolakas_ preys only upon the blood in its own family. It\n     possesses none of the characteristics of the undead vampire,\n     being usually a living male person of otherwise normal\n     appearances, unsuspecting its inherent demonism."
        },
