              "normalization_notes": [],
              "raw_id": "ev10",
              "source": "model",
              "source_chunk_id": null
            }
          ],
          "quote": "But the death of Doctor Henry Duryea confronted the police with an\ninexplicable mystery; for his trussed-up body, unscathed except for two\njagged holes over the jugular vein, _had been drained of all its blood_."
