          "evidence_id": "sfev-e7cf90d946ed2dab",
          "evidence_type": "inquiry_or_scientific_method",
          "paraphrase": "Scholars at the trial could neither explain nor dismiss the deaths, and authorities suppressed the case for fear of undermining science.",
